  "⏳ 新的引擎设置已记录，但本会话还有 1 个后台任务在跑，会在它结束后的下一轮生效（本轮仍用当前设置）。想立刻生效可发 /reset 开新会话。": "⏳ New engine settings were saved, but this session still has 1 background task running. They will take effect on the next turn after the background work finishes (this turn still uses the current settings). Send /reset to start a new session if you want them to take effect immediately.",
  "⏳ 新的引擎设置已记录，但本会话还有 {0} 个后台任务在跑，会在它们结束后的下一轮生效（本轮仍用当前设置）。想立刻生效可发 /reset 开新会话。": "⏳ New engine settings were saved, but this session still has {0} background tasks running. They will take effect on the next turn after the background work finishes (this turn still uses the current settings). Send /reset to start a new session if you want them to take effect immediately.",
