  "[Pi] Pi 没有确认它是否还留有本轮的补充。为避免带入下一轮，已结束这个 Pi 进程（会话记录保留）。请核对本轮回复，确认补充是否已被采纳。": "[Pi] Pi did not confirm whether it still holds additions from this turn. To keep them out of the next turn, this Pi process was ended (the session history is kept). Check this turn's reply to see whether they were applied.",
