  "交付未确认：引擎声称文件或图片已经发送，但本轮没有提供任何可执行的发送指令，因此该说法已被拦截。请明确要求重新生成或重新发送。": "Delivery was not confirmed: the engine claimed the files or images were sent, but this turn contained no executable delivery directive. The claim was blocked; ask it to regenerate or resend.",
  "交付失败：回复使用了无法执行的发送指令。请改用 [send-file:/绝对路径]、[send-image:/绝对路径] 或 send.* 工具调用后重试。": "Delivery failed: the response used an invalid send directive. Use an executable [send-file:/absolute/path], [send-image:/absolute/path], or send.* tool call and try again.",
  "图形未能确认发布。请让 Bot 检查图形内容和交付状态后再处理，详细原因已记录到日志。": "Widget publication was not confirmed. Ask the Bot to check the content and delivery status before retrying. Details were recorded in logs.",
