  "这条补充可能已被 Bot 接收，但暂时无法确认回执，因此没有再次排队。请先核对 Bot 的回复，再决定是否重发，避免重复执行。": "The Bot may have received this follow-up, but its receipt could not be confirmed. It has not been queued again. Check the Bot's reply before resending to avoid duplicate work.",
