  "未找到最近的 {0} session。": "No recent {0} sessions found.",
  "最近的 {0} session": "Recent {0} sessions",
  "用法：`/bg`（列出本实例的引擎/后台进程）· `/bg kill <pid>` 停掉指定进程树 · `/bg killall` 清掉所有孤儿后台进程": "Usage: `/bg` (list this instance's engine/background processes) · `/bg kill <pid>` kill that process tree · `/bg killall` remove all orphaned background processes",
  "已停止进程树 pid={0} ✓": "Killed process tree pid={0} ✓",
  "pid={0} 不在本实例的进程组里（可能已退出）。先用 /bg 看列表。": "pid={0} is not in this instance's process group (it may have exited). Run /bg first.",
