  "Bot 默认思考强度：{0}。它作用于整个 Bot：改动后，这个 Bot 的所有对话从下一轮起都改用新档位。查看或调整当前对话请用 /thinking。": "Bot default thinking level: {0}. It is set for the whole Bot: a change replaces the level in all of this Bot's conversations from their next turn. Use /thinking to see or change this conversation's level.",
