  "Pi 不提供带沙箱的 full-auto，权限未更改。普通审批请用 /yolo off；跳过审批请用 /yolo unsafe，这不会提供 OS 沙箱。": "Pi does not provide sandboxed full-auto. Permissions were not changed. Use /yolo off for normal approval or /yolo unsafe to skip approval without an OS sandbox.",
