  "Claude 原生 /goal 不支持强制 token 预算，本次未启动目标。请去掉 --budget，使用 /goal <完成条件>；需要原生 token 限额时请使用 Codex。": "Claude's native /goal has no enforceable token budget. No goal was started. Send /goal <completion condition> without --budget, or use Codex for a native token limit.",
  "Kimi ACP 当前未提供 /goal 命令（真机返回 Unknown ACP command），bridge 不会把普通聊天伪装成 goal。请直接发送任务，或切换到 Codex、Claude 或 DeepSeek。": "Kimi ACP does not currently provide /goal (the live CLI returns Unknown ACP command), so the bridge will not disguise an ordinary prompt as a goal. Send the task normally or switch to Codex, Claude, or DeepSeek.",
  "Pi 没有 /goal 目标模式，本次没有启动任何任务，也没有改动目标。请直接发送任务；需要目标模式时请切换到 Codex、Claude 或 DeepSeek。": "Pi has no /goal mode, so nothing was started and no goal was changed. Send the task as an ordinary message, or switch to Codex, Claude or DeepSeek for a goal.",
