  // Strings added on main after #173 branched (merged onto 2510c743); Japanese pending
  "omp 会记录提供商返回的用量和费用，费用可能为估算值；主机预算检查不等于原生单轮费用上限。": "omp reports usage and cost when supplied by the provider. Cost may be estimated; a Host budget check does not impose a native per-turn spending limit.",
  "当前模型: {0}\n用 /model <provider/model> 选择 oh-my-pi (omp) 提供的模型。\n/model off\nomp 会通过 RPC 会话模型 API 校验该选择。": "Current model: {0}\nUse /model <provider/model> with a model advertised by oh-my-pi (omp).\n/model off\nomp validates the selection through its RPC session model API.",
  "用法: /engine [claude|codex|kimi|deepseek|antigravity|pi|omp]": "Usage: /engine [claude|codex|kimi|deepseek|antigravity|pi|omp]",
  "omp 不提供带沙箱的 full-auto，权限未更改。工具审批请用 /yolo off；原生访问请用 /yolo unsafe，这不会提供 OS 沙箱。": "omp does not provide sandboxed full-auto. Permissions were not changed. Use /yolo off for tool approval or /yolo unsafe for native access without an OS sandbox.",
  "错误：此 omp 会话已达到费用上限（当前预算使用额度已用完）。请在 omp 中调整或清除上限，或新开对话。": "Error: this omp session reached its cost cap (usage quota is exhausted for this budget). Adjust or clear the cap in omp, or start a new conversation.",
  "omp 提供商凭据缺失或已失效。请在运行 Bot 的主机上运行 `omp` 并执行 `/login`（或更新提供商凭据）后重试；原会话已保留。": "omp provider credentials are missing or expired. Run `omp` and `/login` (or update provider credentials) on the host running this Bot, then retry. Chat history is preserved.",
  "错误：模型服务拒绝了本轮 omp 请求（{0}）。请检查所选模型、思考强度和附件后重试；重启实例无效。原会话已保留，未自动重发请求。": "Error: the model service refused this omp request ({0}). Check the selected model, thinking level and attachments, then retry; restarting the instance will not help. The conversation is preserved and the request was not resent.",
  "错误：模型服务拒绝了本轮 omp 请求。请检查所选模型、思考强度和附件后重试；重启实例无效。原会话已保留，未自动重发请求。": "Error: the model service refused this omp request. Check the selected model, thinking level and attachments, then retry; restarting the instance will not help. The conversation is preserved and the request was not resent.",
