  "Antigravity Bot 支持在对话中直接使用原生工作流命令（`/swarm`、`/swarm board`、`/grill-me`、`/plan`、`/teamwork`、`/run-workflow`、`/browser`、`/goal`、`/learn`、`/schedule`、`/boost`）以及 Antigravity ACP 动态广播的工作区 Skill。侧边追问继续使用 TaroBird 侧边对话或 `/btw`；桌面端专属命令 `/automation` 会指引使用 TaroBird `/cron` 或 `/schedule`。": "Antigravity Bots support native workflow commands (`/swarm`, `/swarm board`, `/grill-me`, `/plan`, `/teamwork`, `/run-workflow`, `/browser`, `/goal`, `/learn`, `/schedule`, `/boost`) directly in chat, plus live workspace skills advertised by Antigravity ACP. Side questions use TaroBird's Side Conversation or `/btw`. Desktop-only `/automation` guides you to TaroBird `/cron` or `/schedule`.",
